menu "espOS WiFi"

    config ESPOS_WIFI_MAX_NETWORKS
        int "Configured networks (priority slots)"
        default 4
        range 1 4
        help
            Number of ssidN/pskN/bssidN slots honoured from the "wifi"
            namespace (the descriptor declares four).

            The mDNS responder that used to be configured here moved to
            espos_net with the seam: CONFIG_ESPOS_NET_MDNS and
            CONFIG_ESPOS_NET_MDNS_MAX_SERVICES under "espOS network".

endmenu
